// @FIGURE_CODE_BEGIN
// socket → stacked vertical CylinderGeometry white/gray base under source bulb
// bulb glass → transparent SphereGeometry plus warm neck, scaled to incandescent bulb shape
// filament → orange/yellow Line coil inside bulb
// source glow → nested translucent CircleGeometry discs in screen-facing plane behind bulb
// unpolarized arrows → six red double-headed cone/cylinder arrows in local YZ plane
// light beam → soft tapered translucent pale-yellow prism ribbons along +X
// polarizer → thin CylinderGeometry disc face + TorusGeometry rim + many vertical Line stripes
// post-polarizer arrows → red vertical double-headed arrows in one polarization plane
// sample tube → transparent CylinderGeometry along X with rounded circular caps and top filling stub
// tube rotation arrows → five red double-headed arrows rotating progressively along tube
// sample label leader → black Line from sample label to tube wall
// analyzer → thin CylinderGeometry disc face + TorusGeometry rim + rotatable stripe Line group
// outgoing beam → soft tapered translucent pale-yellow prism ribbon toward observer
// outgoing arrow → heavy red double-headed arrow at analyzer angle
